{"unit_id": "tag:01MS:proof", "translation": "分次（graded）<MATH_0001>-模（module）映射（maps）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>由\n<MATH_0004>给出，在对<MATH_0005>取逆（inverting）后成为同构（isomorphisms）。前者表明\n<MATH_0006>，由此得到一个同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0007>。\n后者表明映射（map）\n<MATH_0008>\n是同构（isomorphism）。映射（map）（<REF_0001>）的情形可由映射（map）（<REF_0002>）的情形推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "inverting", "target_term": "取逆"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰此处的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指所述映射涉及的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "统称由同一公式给出的两个映射。"}, {"source_term": "inverting", "target_term": "取逆", "context": "指使指定元素可逆的操作。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明取逆后两个映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "指由第一个映射所得结论给出的同构。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指随后判定为同构的映射。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "说明由第二个映射判定出的性质。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指末句中其情形有待推出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指末句中其情形用以推出前一情形的映射。"}], "notes": []}
